  "question": {
    "text": "A horizontal semi-circular wire of radius $\\mathrm{r}$ is connected to a battery through two similar springs $\\mathrm{X}$ and $\\mathrm{Y}$ to an electric cell, which sends current I through it. A vertically downward uniform magnetic field B is applied on the wire, as shown in the figure. What is the force acting on each spring?\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/ZxajP_msPkg4t3zAonun29cvusg0wH9BzVqAaN9Sw-U.original.fullsize.png\">",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
